WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Alright,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.000
a number series!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:10.600
Four,

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.200
seven,

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:11.800
ten,

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.400
thirteen,

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.600
and then...

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.400
what comes next?

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.000
A.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:16.600
Sixteen,

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.200
B.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:17.800
Seventeen,

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.400
C.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.000
Nineteen,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.200
or D.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:20.800
Fifteen?

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.000
Five seconds!

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.000
TIME'S UP!

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:30.233
It's...

00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:30.800
A,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.367
sixteen!

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:34.767
Each number goes up by three:

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:35.333
four,

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:35.900
seven,

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.467
ten,

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:37.033
thirteen,

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:40.433
so the next is thirteen plus

00:00:40.433 --> 00:00:42.133
three is sixteen.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:43.967
Alright!

00:00:43.967 --> 00:00:47.267
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:47.933
A.

00:00:47.933 --> 00:00:48.600
Road,

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.267
B.

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:49.933
Car,

00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:50.600
C.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.267
Bus,

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:52.600
or D.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.267
Train?

00:00:53.267 --> 00:00:54.567
Five seconds!

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:01.567
TIME'S UP!

00:01:02.233 --> 00:01:02.633
It's...

00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:03.033
A,

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:03.467
road!

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.267
A car,

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:04.667
bus,

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:07.100
and train are all vehicles that

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.933
carry people.

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.367
A road is what they drive

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:10.767
on,

00:01:10.767 --> 00:01:12.800
so it does not belong.

00:01:13.933 --> 00:01:15.033
Here's one,

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.667
a number puzzle,

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:18.300
and it's sneaky!

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:21.567
If two plus three makes six,

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.267
four plus two makes eight,

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:27.000
five plus three makes fifteen,

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.733
then six plus two makes...

00:01:29.733 --> 00:01:30.267
what?

00:01:30.267 --> 00:01:30.800
A.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:31.367
Eight,

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:31.900
B.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:32.433
Fourteen,

00:01:32.433 --> 00:01:33.000
C.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:33.533
Twelve,

00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:34.633
or D.

00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:35.167
Sixteen?

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:36.267
Five seconds!

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:43.233
TIME'S UP!

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:45.300
The answer is...

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:45.767
C,

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:46.233
twelve!

00:01:46.233 --> 00:01:49.033
The plus sign secretly means multiply:

00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:51.400
two times three is six,

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.733
four times two is eight,

00:01:53.733 --> 00:01:56.533
so six times two is twelve.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.100
So,

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.133
are you smart or fart?

00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:02.567
Count up your correct answers to

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:03.767
find your rank!

00:02:04.933 --> 00:02:05.267
So,

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:06.667
how did you do?

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.033
Comment your score below,

00:02:08.033 --> 00:02:09.400
and follow for more!
